    "created": "2026-08-25",
    "description": "The patch a first-time visitor meets. A clocked eight-step line through a saw oscillator and a resonant lowpass — small enough to read left to right in one glance, and loud enough about the filter that dragging the cutoff is unmistakable. The onboarding tour teaches this patch and nothing else.",
    "name": "Start Here",
    "tags": [
      "onboarding",
      "demo",
      "sequence"
    ]
  },
